        "name": "explanation",
        "score": 8,
        "rationale": "The reply clearly links the evidence (the workflow line, the missing file, the run 77001 log and annotation, the local reproduction) to the cause, an obsolete test module reference, and then to the existing fix branch with its ahead/behind status. It states its limits, such as not knowing whether a PR is open, and adds a relevant hardening note. Points come off because offering the local edit as an alternative blurs the single next step."
      }
    ],
